+## Timing rule
+`grace` = 60 minutes (A-return-04).
+- `early` if `returned_at < due_at - grace`.
+- `late` if `returned_at > due_at + grace`.
+- `on_time` otherwise.
+- `lateness_minutes` = 0 unless `timing = late`; then `ceil((returned_at - due_at) / 60 s)`.
